 "claim_boundary": {
  "exposure": "Same 161 exposed development advisories; stock queries, no tuning.",
  "environment": "Offline extraction, matching production workers that run with network none: the Go module proxy, Go toolchain downloads, Maven Central and the .NET installer are blocked by the host egress policy (HTTP 403). Go ran with GOPROXY=off and GOFLAGS=-mod=mod on go1.24.7; Java and C# used --build-mode=none.",
  "method": "Each advisory's repository was fetched at depth 1 at the first fix parent (the record's source_revision). Query selection, argv and the fix-hunk detection rule are the baseline record's codeql_lane, unchanged. CodeQL CLI 2.27.1."
 },
